<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS4" title="In III-C Case Study ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span>4 </span>Budget (Jobs) Restrictions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS5" title="In III-C Case Study ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span>5 </span>Accuracy Requirements</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS6" title="In III-C Case Study ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span>6 </span>Other Restrictions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS3.SSS7" title="In III-C Case Study ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-C</span>7 </span>Target Code</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS4" title="In III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Preliminary Result</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS5" title="In III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-E</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Discussion</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
