<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS5.SSS2" title="In III-E Discussion ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-E</span>2 </span>Generated Codes</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS5.SSS3" title="In III-E Discussion ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">III-E</span>3 </span>Summary</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">IV </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Related Work</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
