<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Shun-ichiro Hayashi
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
