<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S3.SS3.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span> </span><span id="S3.SS3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Case Study</span></h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We conducted experiments in an HPC supercomputer environment with system-dependent configurations, batch job submission, and point-based resource management. These specifications are detailed in the requirements definition.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We selected matrix–matrix multiplication tuning as a representative case study of HPC optimization. The provided code is a naive matrix–matrix multiplication implementation in C with a triple-nested loop structure, and it includes functionality for result verification.</p>
</div>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS1.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>1 </span>Assigned Task</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S3.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Performance Goals</p>
<ul id="S3.I2.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Target Performance: Approach as closely as possible to the theoretical peak performance of the GPU.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Optimize up to the single-node limit.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compute theoretical performance separately for ‘1 GPU’ and ‘4 GPUs’.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Priorities</p>
<ul id="S3.I2.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Accuracy Assurance</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximization of Throughput</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Improvement of Scalability (in terms of GPU count and matrix size)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="S3.SS3.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provided the system with prompts assigning the following roles. For details, see Appendix A.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS2.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>2 </span>Operation of iterative prompting in VibeCodeHPC</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="S3.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S3.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Generate code on the local PC.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Transfer the generated code to the “Flow” Type II.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(3)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compile on the “Flow” Type II via login (‘make’).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Submit and execute the job on the scheduler using the ‘pjsub’ command.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I3.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(5)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Check the results (verify execution speed).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I3.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(6)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Issue code modification instructions.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I3.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(7)</span> 
<div id="S3.I3.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I3.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Return to step 1.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS3.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>3 </span>Agent Configuration</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The maximum multi-agent setup is fixed as follows: a PM, a SE, a PG <math id="S3.SS3.SSS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> 3 agents, and a CD.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS4.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>4 </span>Budget (Jobs) Restrictions</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S3.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Computational Resource Budget</p>
<ul id="S3.I4.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Minimum Consumption Line: 100 points</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reference: 500 points</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximum: 1,000 points</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The “Flow” Type II Rate</p>
<ul id="S3.I4.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I4.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i2.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Points are calculated as elapsed time (seconds) <math id="S3.I4.i2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> 0.007 <math id="S3.I4.i2.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> number of GPUs used.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Time Limit</p>
<ul id="S3.I4.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Minimum: 120 min (2 hours)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Reference: 150 min (2.5 hours)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I4.i3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Maximum: 180 min (3 hours)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS5" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS5.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>5 </span>Accuracy Requirements</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S3.I5" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The PM shall set an appropriate target accuracy and share it across the team.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Prepare test routines that ensure accuracy comparable to general numerical libraries like BLAS.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Errors must always be computed using a suitable method and documented in the ChangeLog.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS6" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS6.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>6 </span>Other Restrictions</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The use of numerical libraries such as ‘cuBLAS’ or ‘MKL’ is prohibited. The goal is to see how close performance can get to them.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3.SSS7" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S3.SS3.SSS7.4" class="ltx_text">III-C</span>7 </span>Target Code</h4>

<div id="S3.SS3.SSS7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.SSS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The naive implementation of matrix-matrix multiplication shown in Listing <a href="#LST1" title="Listing 1 ‣ III-C7 Target Code ‣ III-C Case Study ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 1: </span>Target code: Naive Implementation of Matrix-Matrix Multiplication.</figcaption>
<div id="LST1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_C ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">void</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">gemm_naive</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">(</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">int</span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">M</span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">int</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">N</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">int</span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">K</span><span id="lstnumberx1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">                </span><span id="lstnumberx2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">double</span><span id="lstnumberx2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">alpha</span><span id="lstnumberx2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">const</span><span id="lstnumberx2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">double</span><span id="lstnumberx2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">*</span><span id="lstnumberx2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">A</span><span id="lstnumberx2.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span><span id="lstnumberx2.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF00FF;">int</span><span id="lstnumberx2.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx2.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">lda</span><span id="lstnumberx2.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">,</span>
</div>
