<section id="S3.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S3.SS4.4" class="ltx_text">III-D</span> </span><span id="S3.SS4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Preliminary Result</span></h3>

<div id="S3.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fig. <a href="#S3.F3" title="Fig. 3 ‣ III-D Preliminary Result ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows the performance (in GFLOPS) achieved by the generated code over elapsed execution time for both the solo-agent and multi-agent cases.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F3" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.00031v1/fig/fig3.png" id="S3.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/339;" width="476" height="339" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 3: </span>Performance comparison: solo-agent vs multi-agents.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Fig. <a href="#S3.F3" title="Fig. 3 ‣ III-D Preliminary Result ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows that the multi-agents approach succeeded in generating higher-performance code within the same relative time. In addition, while the solo-agent generated a prohibited cuBLAS-based implementation and terminated, the multi-agents continued to generate progressively higher-performing code as time elapsed. From this perspective, the multi-agent approach produced superior code.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">As a summary of Fig. <a href="#S3.F3" title="Fig. 3 ‣ III-D Preliminary Result ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, successful optimization methods are as follows:</p>
<ul id="S3.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Shared memory tiling (v1.0.0) – Achieved 23.10%.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Warp optimization and unrolling (v1.0.1) – Achieved 24.21%.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Register tiling 4x4 (v1.2.1) – Achieved 28.02%.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I6.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I6.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I6.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Double buffering (v1.4.0) – Achieved 43.14%.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I6.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I6.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I6.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Utilization of read-only cache (v1.4.0) – Contributed to performance improvement.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Next, Table <a href="#S3.T2" title="TABLE II ‣ III-D Preliminary Result ‣ III Performance Evaluation ‣ VibeCodeHPC: An Agent-Based Iterative Prompting Auto-Tuner for HPC Code Generation Using LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">II</span></a> presents the version history of the code generated by the multi-agents. Here, the correctness of the code execution is verified by evaluating the 2-norm of the difference between the result of the matrix-matrix multiplication and the original matrix C.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE II: </span>Code version history in multi-agents.</figcaption>
<table id="S3.T2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S3.T2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="S3.T2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ver.</span></th>
<th id="S3.T2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="S3.T2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GFLOPS</span></th>
<th id="S3.T2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="S3.T2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Efficiency</span></th>
<th id="S3.T2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="S3.T2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Key Optimization / Status</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S3.T2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">v1.0.0</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">1803.7</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">23.10%</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Baseline / Valid</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">v1.0.1</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">1888.5</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">24.21%</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Warp optimization / Valid</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">v1.2.1</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">2185.2</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">28.02%</td>
<td id="S3.T2.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Register blocking / Valid</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">v1.3.0</td>
